<h2 class="bde-heading-506-115 bde-heading">
What Is Tyus Jones’s 2026-27 Salary?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-116 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-139 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-151 bde-f-text">
<p>Jones earns <strong>$3.88m</strong> in 2026-27 at the veteran minimum, ninth on the <a href="/teams/denver-nuggets/">Denver</a> payroll. He was paid <strong>$15m</strong> in 2022-23, which is close to four times the figure.</p>
<p>His career earnings come to <strong>$65.47m</strong> across twelve seasons at five clubs. The salary is <strong>1.78%</strong> of Denver’s <strong>$217.46m</strong> payroll.</p>

