<h2 class="bde-heading-506-117 bde-heading">
What Does Tyus Jones’s Contract With the Nuggets Include?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>Jones signed a one-year contract with Denver on July 14, 2026 at the veteran minimum, worth <strong>$3.88m</strong> with everything guaranteed.</p>
<p>It follows a rest-of-season deal he signed at the club in March 2026, and it is the third minimum contract of his last three summers. He becomes an unrestricted free agent again in 2027.</p>

</div><div class="bde-shortcode-506-191 bde-shortcode"><div class="nba-fin" data-nba-fin="proportions">
