<h2 class="bde-heading-506-126 bde-heading">
How Much Is Tyus Jones Worth?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-127 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-143 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-shortcode-506-157 bde-shortcode"><div class="nba-fin" data-nba-fin="worth">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/_ported/08ba6176394a.css">
<div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Estimated Net Worth</div><div class="nf-value">$26M</div><div class="nf-rank">Estimated from career earnings</div></div><script src="/_ported/8334868131c3.js" is:inline></script>
</div>
</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Jones’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$26m</strong>, derived from his <strong>$65.47m</strong> in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him.</p>
<p><a href="/teams/minnesota-timberwolves/">Minnesota</a> drafted him 24th in 2015 out of Duke, where he had won a national championship as a freshman. His older brother Tre also plays in the league.</p>

</div>
