<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/tyus-jones/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/tyus-jones/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Tyus Jones’s 2026-27 Salary?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Jones earns $3.88m in 2026-27 at the veteran minimum, ninth on the Denver payroll. He was paid $15m in 2022-23, which is close to four times the figure. His career earnings come to $65.47m across twelve seasons at five clubs. The salary is 1.78% of Denver’s $217.46m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Tyus Jones Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The contract expires at the end of this season and he becomes an unrestricted free agent in 2027 at 31. Backup point guards of his kind usually sign a run of one-year minimum deals from here, which is the pattern of the last three summers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Tyus Jones Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $3.88m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Does Tyus Jones’s Contract With the Nuggets Include?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Jones signed a one-year contract with Denver on July 14, 2026 at the veteran minimum, worth $3.88m with everything guaranteed. It follows a rest-of-season deal he signed at the club in March 2026, and it is the third minimum contract of his last three summers. He becomes an unrestricted free agent again in 2027."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Tyus Jones Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Jones’s net worth is estimated at around $26m, derived from his $65.47m in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him. Minnesota drafted him 24th in 2015 out of Duke, where he had won a national championship as a freshman. His older brother Tre also plays in the league."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Tyus Jones on $3.88m in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Jones is paid $3.88m because he is a backup point guard in his thirties, and the veteran minimum is what that job pays now. He and DeMar DeRozan are paid exactly the same figure this season."}}]}</script>
